# 本地 RTL 子任务契约 `v8k-native-no-tools-workflow-review`

- 工程领域：本地 RV64 Verilog/SystemVerilog 数字电路设计、验证或 PPA
- 任务类型：`read-only-review`
- 执行模式：`self-contained-no-tools`（无工具、无 shell、无文件访问）
- 目标：Review whether the local RV64 RTL native self-contained no-tools contract is privilege-exact, backward-compatible, and accurately worded without claiming to bypass platform review

